data: {"id": "85947cffe27943b4-thinking-parallel_evidence-264", "run_id": "85947cffe27943b4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "OK，我现在已经看到了代码预采集的可观测性 baseline 结果：\n- metrics: present - 显示 waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff, last_terminated_reason=Error, restarts=14\n- logging: present - ES 日志显示反复出现 CONFIG_MISSING, http_status 500\n- tracing: present - DeepFlow flows 和 Tempo spans 显示 GET /work 返回 500, trace_ids 已关联\n\n这些结果看起来已经非常有力地指向了配置缺失导致的应用退出。现在我需要继续执行既有 evidence_plan 中的其他工具来补充完整证据链：\n1. kubectl_describe pod - 确认 Last State、Exit Code 等详细信息\n2. kubectl_logs --previous - 获取崩溃前的日志\n3. kubectl_events - 查看事件\n4. kubectl_get_yaml - 查看资", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788447050605, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

