data: {"id": "85947cffe27943b4-final", "run_id": "85947cffe27943b4", "seq": 1739, "ts_ms": 1788447154875, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx处于CrashLoopBackOff状态，容器启动后立即退出 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 111s (x224 over 51m) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app` | 确认容器经历了长达 51 分钟的频繁重启，且已进入指数退避状态。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: Error`, `container.last_exit_code: 78` | 明确终止原因及退出码，排除 OOMKilled 或探针失败等常见原因。 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `CONFIG_MISSING` (8次, `/work`, HTTP 500, 14:21-14:47) | 日志聚合展示应用启动后持续因配置缺失报错并返回 500。 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow | `GET /work` Flow (9次, `response_code: 500`, 耗时 5260-47772μs) | 追踪层确认流量确实到达 Pod 并被处理，证实应用进程处于“存活但崩溃”的 CrashLoop 状态。 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Tempo | `app_span`: `exit_code: 78`, `mode: config_missing_exit`, Trace ID: `65684c...` | 与日志 Fact 3 的 Trace ID 及日志模式一致，直接证实应用因配置缺失主动调用退出接口。 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff` (value: 1) | 指标状态与 K8s 事件完全一致，确认异常状态持续存在。 |\n\n**证据印证关系：**\n证据 1 和 2 提供了宏观的崩溃重启现象和退出码。证据 3（日志）与证据 5（Trace）通过 `exit_code: 78` 和 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式形成了闭环：应用启动后处理请求（证据 4 证实服务端口可达），遇到缺失配置触发致命错误，记录日志并退出（证据 3、5），导致 Kubernetes 重启容器（证据 1、2）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-code' 中缺少应用所需的特定配置或环境变量 → 应用处理请求时触发 CONFIG_MISSING 致命错误并返回 500 → 容器进程因未捕获的配置错误崩溃退出（Exit Code 78） → Kubernetes 重启策略触发 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：应用启动后在 `/work` 请求中遇到 `CONFIG_MISSING` 致命错误并主动退出（Exit Code 78）。\n\n依据证据 3、4、5，应用进程已成功启动且网络端口可达（Deepflow Flow 确认请求到达且耗时正常），但应用逻辑中检测到关键配置缺失后，无法继续正常运行，导致每次请求均返回 500 并最终触发进程退出。Kubernetes 的自动重启策略因此进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。\n\n*注：ConfigMap 'workload-code' 中具体缺失的 key 或应用代码中检查该配置的具体逻辑位置属于未知项，不影响当前故障现象的根因判定。*\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 120.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 120.6s (Evidence 110.4s, RCA 10.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 151.507, "metrics": {"run_id": "85947cffe27943b4", "mttr": {"value": "2.5m", "seconds": 151.51590037345886, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 151515.90037345886, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 93208.25529098511, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 140212.71181106567, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 57776.03840827942}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19777.398347854614, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 120643.32056045532, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11052.278280258179, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

